{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":113780,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ojIICjgH0ZH4aYPhXersZ02mVeH.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2530221","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Masaki is a middle school student in Oarai. When he takes his pet corgi for an early morning walk on the beach, he sees Sho surfing. He's so enthralled by the sight of Sho that when he's asked if he wants surf, he immediately agrees to start. That's the moment when surfing becomes his life.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8CEPjR2anRmVmle5yeitZ5KPyCP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8CEPjR2anRmVmle5yeitZ5KPyCP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2635100","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Since the moment he took it up, Masaki's life has become all about surfing. Sleeping or waking, it's all he thinks about, and he goes out to the beach to ride the waves rain or shine. One day, with a typhoon approaching, Masaki ignores Sho's attempt to stop him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1h1tnKAg7dOKn0aS73Nw2mZNHFJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1h1tnKAg7dOKn0aS73Nw2mZNHFJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2635101","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's almost time for the curtain to rise on Masaki's first competition - the Forest Cup in Oarai. Many surfers the same age as Masaki will be in the competition, and they will prove to be worthy, life-long rivals. It's been a year since Masaki first met Sho. A year since he started surfing. In order to prove that this last year of training hasn't been in vain, Masaki is determined to do everything he can with everything he's got. And so, he sets out to challenge the waves...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-01-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u9FVfsH2xbpOIdPtt0lEyXmOErj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9FVfsH2xbpOIdPtt0lEyXmOErj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2635102","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The final round of the Forest Cup in Oarai comes down to Sho and Tanaka. Each of them challenge the waves with everything they've got, showing amazing runs, but there can only be one winner, and the winner is... Masaki is proud of both of them, and at the same time, he decides to work even harder to aim even higher. He and the others make a promise - to aim for the world stage together as friendly rivals...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8yNFQ0FYaaieWTL7Fi9QfxJSCNa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8yNFQ0FYaaieWTL7Fi9QfxJSCNa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2635103","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Masaki is spending his days in a quiet, detached way, going to school, taking class, then going home. Since that day, he hasn't ridden the waves even once. But no matter how much he wants to resent surfing, wants to hate it, wants to quit it...he can't rid himself of the love he has for it. One night, under a full moon, Masaki laments alone on the Oarai shore. Tanaka quietly approaches. Moonlight. The sound of waves. And then, Masaki...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wxOEHGXRYKmmVcfOAOHbwrSgaFz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wxOEHGXRYKmmVcfOAOHbwrSgaFz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2635104","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"伝説のシェイパー、タダオの家に下宿し、湘南でサーフィン漬けの充実した高校生活を送るマサキ。あるとき、マサキはささいなことの積み重ねで、コウスケを怒らせてしまう。憤懣やるかたないコウスケはマサキに勝負を挑む……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yqK4SoLYyCZPyAR4iDn8N7KmEwF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yqK4SoLYyCZPyAR4iDn8N7KmEwF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2635105","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"波情報アプリ『シラスWAVE』を運営しているユータ。天気や風、波の情報を毎日更新している。しかし最近ユータの様子が何かおかしい。なんと『シラスWAVE』を終了するという。まさかサーフィンを辞めるつもりか？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r4pfa2nzbgXbxs8AHHZvi73avio.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r4pfa2nzbgXbxs8AHHZvi73avio.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2635106","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"人気アニメ『マジカルメイドみるる』のファンミーティングのために湘南にやってきたナオヤは、みるるの放送が終わるという情報を目にして落ち込む。気分転換のためにとナオヤを観光へと連れ出すマサキたちだがなかなかうまくいかず……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3iB5mHrADoD0PlzLY1tp15ahqHA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3iB5mHrADoD0PlzLY1tp15ahqHA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2635107","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"絶好のコンディションで開幕する『フォレストカップin釣ヶ崎』。優勝候補筆頭はフケ。コウスケ、ユータ、ナオヤ、ビルもそれぞれ優勝を目指して波に挑む。マサキも健闘し、観客の大きな歓声を浴びるが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hzUah3C6R6ajUKWG2Zh3Qw0JlON.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hzUah3C6R6ajUKWG2Zh3Qw0JlON.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2635108","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ビルは、突如マサキたちをハワイへ特訓に連れて行く。ハワイで田中と再会するマサキたち。観光を楽しみ、ビルの別荘の豪華さに驚き、そして、ノースショアのビッグウェーブに目を輝かせる。そこでフケにも出会ったマサキたちは教えを乞うが、フケは「あの男に頼めばどうだ」とひとりのサーファーを指す。その男は、ショウによく似ていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rJse64biVPLuo0wYRIeu6RJD0yF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rJse64biVPLuo0wYRIeu6RJD0yF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2635109","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ハワイで、ショウの兄ハヤミチに教えを受けるマサキたち。マサキは、ハヤミチに教わり、ショウのようなサーフィンができるようになりたいと練習に精を出す。しかし、ハヤミチは「お前は、ショウにはなれない」とマサキを突き放す。真意をはかりかねショックを受けるマサキは練習中に波に巻かれ、薄れゆく意識の中、ショウの声を聞く……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6psdbnfI7BWJKx789nOcrcj3Fwk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6psdbnfI7BWJKx789nOcrcj3Fwk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"2696153","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"マサキの故郷の大洗で、マサキとコウスケ、ユータ、ナオヤは強化合宿を行っていた。そこへふらりと現れるフケ。フケはマサキたちを、ライバルだと認め、４年後に開かれる世界大会の強化選手を決める大会での健闘を誓い合う。マサキは湘南へと戻る前に、ショウが育った街、葉山を訪れ、ショウを越え、どんな波も越え、未来へ進むと決意する！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-03-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dCV8pNUYg0YEIV5TgOgghH5SRD8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dCV8pNUYg0YEIV5TgOgghH5SRD8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113780/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793645344398,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}}}
